Revision history for RPi-DigiPot-MCP4XXXX

3.1802 UNREL
    - Fixed shutdown() to bracket the SPI write with CS (LOW before / HIGH
      after), matching set(); previously the command never latched when CS is
      driven as a manual GPIO
    - Fixed shutdown()'s bad-$pot error message, which wrongly named set()
      (copy-paste); it now reads "shutdown() $pot param must be 1-3"
    - Added t/set_shutdown.t: HW-free unit coverage of set()/shutdown() via
      Mock::Sub - asserts the exact SPI control/data bytes (0x11/0x13 for set,
      0x21/0x22 for shutdown), the CS-LOW/SPI/CS-HIGH framing order, and the
      data/pot validation croaks, all without a Pi
    - Added DEVICE SPECIFICS and ON THE WIRE sections to TECHNICAL
      INFORMATION: chip capabilities, wiring map, and the 16-bit command frame
      diagrammed with worked set()/shutdown() examples, verified against the
      MCP41XXX/42XXX datasheet (DS11195C)
    - Added a DATASHEET POD section pointing to the bundled
      docs/datasheet/mcp4xxxx.pdf; repointed the TECHNICAL INFORMATION
      datasheet link off its github.io URL
    - Added t/set_shutdown.t to MANIFEST (was on disk but unlisted)
    - Dropped the vestigial LIBS => ['-lwiringPi'] from Makefile.PL; this dist
      is pure Perl (no XS), so nothing links wiringPi - the entry was inert
      leftover from a former XS incarnation
    - Removed a duplicate LICENSE key from Makefile.PL (it was set twice, to
      'Perl_5' then 'perl_5'); kept the single canonical 'perl_5'

3.1801    2026-06-12
    - Migrated constants from removed RPi::WiringPi::Constant to
      RPi::Const (incl. Makefile.PL prereq)
    - The test suite board gate is now RPI_BOARD (ecosystem-wide rename
      from PI_BOARD); the old name is no longer honored
    - Bump prereq of WiringPi::API to 3.1801
    - Bump prereq of RPi::Const to 1.05

2.3604 2017-06-28
    - bump prereq ver of WiringPi::API to 2.3612
    - bump prereq ver of RPi::WiringPi::Constant to 1.00

2.3603  2017-03-13
    - changed version scheme from 2.36.x to 2.360x

2.36.2  2017-02-22
    - fix missed method name in SYNOPSIS
    - added link to the datasheet in POD
    - bumped prereq of EUMM to 6.72 to ensure multi-digit prereq versions
      are adhered to
    - bypass t/init.t if PI_BOARD env var isn't true (closes #22)

2.36.1  2017-01-22
    - WiringPi::API 2.36.3 and RPi::WiringPi::Constant 0.02 are prereqs
    - added technical specifications
    - MocK::Sub now a TEST_REQUIRES
    - added _bytes(), returns aref of bytes to send to SPI
    - added set(), sets the output of the potentiometer(s)
    - added shutdown(), shuts down the potentiometer(s) per the datasheet
    - added tests for the base functionality, and bit manipulation
